   should have target_branches = {"B1(AML)": "against", "B2(CML)": "support"}.

3. Score each candidate (all components 0-1):
     LeafScore = ExpectedInformationGain
               + SafetyValue
               + ActionSeparationValue
               + FalsificationValue
